155→    // These tests verify the shouldDelete branch in close(): a writer in OPEN
156→    // state (finish() never called) must delete its partial output file on close().
157→    // They complement the existing closeWithoutFinishDeletesFile test.
158→    // -------------------------------------------------------------------------
